nk towards the survey app does not open. I will try sometime later hoping to have access to it',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36','comment',0,0),(749,49,'Alain Bahane','alainbahanep@gmail.com','','41.186.132.26','2026-02-10 14:55:33','2026-02-10 14:55:33','This page gave me a clear understanding of front-end web development, and I believe it will help others as well. The explanations of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and HTTP are simple and easy to follow for beginners. It’s a great place for us to start learning and grow step by step in web development.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36','comment',0,0),(750,2,'Alain Bahane','alainbahanep@gmail.com','','41.186.132.26','2026-02-10 15:01:00','2026-02-10 15:01:00','This page really speaks to me, and I believe it can help those who are learning or freelancing in software development. The journey is explained in a simple and motivating way, from learning skills to working with teams and finding opportunities. It’s clear, practical, and encouraging for all of us who want to grow step by step.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36','comment',0,0),(751,49,'Celestin Yusse','yussecelestin@gmail.com','','41.243.4.187','2026-02-11 20:41:58','2026-02-11 20:41:58','What a concise and helpful presentation. It is interesting to learn web development on this platform. This is a wide, well-structured front-end presentation. I can\'t wait to learn more.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/144.0.0.0','comment',0,0),(752,2,'Nathaniel Brooks','nathaniel.reid@jmailservice.com','https://www.google.com','132.255.133.41','2026-02-13 21:44:12','2026-02-13 21:44:12','Imagine showing up first whenever someone searche